{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Greatest Common Factor 是一款專注於因數、最大公因數與分數約分的數學工具，適合學生、家長及需要快速核對分數運算的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-111.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一站式因數與約分工具</h2>\n<p>開啟應用後，用家可輸入數字取得其所有因數，亦可輸入兩個或以上數字，找出能整除各數而沒有餘數的最大公因數。應用同時支援分數約分，將分子與分母除以兩者的最大公因數，得出最簡分數。因數、最大公因數與約分功能互相配合，方便學生理解步驟，也讓日常計算時快速核對結果。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-354-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-355-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-356-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-357-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Greatest Common Factor</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/greatest-common-factor/id1573121817?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:40:19.099532+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T22:37:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:18:53.054079+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:28.711911+00:00","content_hash":"e8d2d285d6a835333671523e31c1124fa6f32944efab5a2c4946dec82d2916af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}